abstract: >-
  Reproducible spatial analysis of neighbourhood-level urban change in Lisbon,
  combining housing values, local-accommodation pressure, Censos 2021 context,
  spatial autocorrelation diagnostics, and pre-specified multivariable models.
keywords:
  - Lisbon
  - spatial analysis
  - housing
  - local accommodation
  - urban change
  - reproducible research
